mpte 84 appartements.\nAdagio, le leader européen des appart'hôtels, assure une gestion solide et une expertise reconnue dans l'hébergement urbain de longue durée, avec plus de 120 résidences en Europe.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire, veuillez contacter :\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"2 Rue Pierre Expert","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjgwNDk3ZTQzYWQyYzY3ZGRkMjU2MDBhMzcwMmI3ZGE3YWEyZTE5ZTIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIyMzQxYWYyNGQwZTc4NzQwMzdhY2NlYmJmNDM0NTAxOSJ9?signature=9e597ebfbdd13305fdad68c87d75262313db18bc1e4710dc8a92f505b8f6359b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjA3OTIwNGYzMmMwMWQ5OWM2Njg5NzYwODI5Y2IyODdiMzFhNTA4NjkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJkZTNiMGViOWZmOGI0MzQxMzk0MTViMjcyODRmOTlkYiJ9?signature=117463816cb9f6834af098dd6f6bd006bec70e133707a60da5bbca0a381403c9","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImJjYmFkOTUzMTkyODZhYzIzOTc3NThlMWIwZmU0Y2NkYTVhODYxYWMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI1NGFjOThkYWYwMDgzMjdiYTJmNTAwY2M2N2ZmNjkxMSJ9?signature=d7c9ee7c822b134a9ffaa1fa86b62c3b17a9bed722bdfd11664f130f0fb6f86e","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjEyZmQ4YzFlNmU1ODBjYzI5MjZmZGE0MzA2MjU5ZTU1ZWQyYWVhMTkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4NzFmZmI3NzJkNmU0OTg5Zjg2ZTUwZWFiMDkyNmRmZSJ9?signature=5e9ae174a1a7e6b7613113878236ab44b5d717ade7972772ef2952676667df31","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImM4YmZkMTlkMzZlZGU4M2JiNzkyZWMwNGViN2U2Njg4YmJmN